{"id":"64d6f11083f002d7","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-internal-functor.md","title":"df-internal-functor","display":"df-internal-functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-internal-functor","aliases":["16-df-internal-functor","Internal functor"],"display":"df-internal-functor","depends_on":["[[16-df-internal-category]]"],"source":"Definition 7.2.1(i), p. 415 (PDF 435)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-internal-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-internal-functor</span><span>Internal functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-internal-functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"75d304b3477bee01\" href=\"?note=75d304b3477bee01\" title=\"16-df-internal-category\">16-df-internal-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 7.2.1(i), p. 415 (PDF 435)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为具有拉回的范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(C_0,C_1,d_0^C,d_1^C,e_C,m_C)\">\\(C=(C_0,C_1,d_0^C,d_1^C,e_C,m_C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=(D_0,D_1,d_0^D,d_1^D,e_D,m_D)\">\\(D=(D_0,D_1,d_0^D,d_1^D,e_D,m_D)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75d304b3477bee01\" href=\"?note=75d304b3477bee01\" title=\"16-df-internal-category\">16-df-internal-category</a> 的内部范畴。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_2,D_2\">\\(C_2,D_2\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^C,\\pi_i^D\">\\(\\pi_i^C,\\pi_i^D\\)</span> 取该定义的可复合对拉回，均按后继、先行箭头的次序排列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0:C_0\\to D_0\">\\(F_0:C_0\\to D_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1:C_1\\to D_1\">\\(F_1:C_1\\to D_1\\)</span> 是候选箭头。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntFunctor}_{\\mathcal B}(F_0,F_1):C\\to D\">\\(\\mathrm{IntFunctor}_{\\mathcal B}(F_0,F_1):C\\to D\\)</span> 是下列公式定义的谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_2\">\\(F_2\\)</span> 只在该公式的存在量词内使用，不预设任意候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0,F_1\">\\(F_0,F_1\\)</span> 都诱导它。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IntFunctor}_{\\mathcal B}(F_0,F_1):C\\to D\\bigr)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nd_0^D F_1=F_0d_0^C\\land d_1^D F_1=F_0d_1^C\\\\\n&amp;\\land F_1e_C=e_DF_0\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists F_2\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(C_2,D_2))\\Bigl[\n\\pi_1^D F_2=F_1\\pi_1^C\\land\\pi_2^D F_2=F_1\\pi_2^C\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land F_1m_C=m_DF_2\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IntFunctor}_{\\mathcal B}(F_0,F_1):C\\to D\\bigr)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nd_0^D F_1=F_0d_0^C\\land d_1^D F_1=F_0d_1^C\\\\\n&amp;\\land F_1e_C=e_DF_0\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists F_2\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(C_2,D_2))\\Bigl[\n\\pi_1^D F_2=F_1\\pi_1^C\\land\\pi_2^D F_2=F_1\\pi_2^C\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land F_1m_C=m_DF_2\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>源靶保持使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1\\pi_1^C,F_1\\pi_2^C\">\\(F_1\\pi_1^C,F_1\\pi_2^C\\)</span> 满足目标拉回的兼容条件；拉回泛性质给出唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_2\">\\(F_2\\)</span>。因此此式与原书的四个交换图等价，同时对不保持源靶的候选记录仍是良定义的假谓词。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Definition 7.2.1(i), p. 415（PDF 435）；按本目录的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(g,f)\">\\((g,f)\\)</span> 顺序同步交换投影。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-internal-category","status":"resolved","id":"75d304b3477bee01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-category","status":"resolved","id":"75d304b3477bee01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B$ 为具有拉回的范畴；$C=(C_0,C_1,d_0^C,d_1^C,e_C,m_C)$、$D=(D_0,D_1,d_0^D,d_1^D,e_D,m_D)$ 是 [[16-df-internal-category]] 的内部范畴。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"C=(C_0,C_1,d_0^C,d_1^C,e_C,m_C)","display":false},{"tex":"D=(D_0,D_1,d_0^D,d_1^D,e_D,m_D)","display":false},{"tex":"C_2,D_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_i^C,\\pi_i^D","display":false},{"tex":"F_0:C_0\\to D_0","display":false},{"tex":"F_1:C_1\\to D_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntFunctor}_{\\mathcal B}(F_0,F_1):C\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"F_2","display":false},{"tex":"F_0,F_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IntFunctor}_{\\mathcal B}(F_0,F_1):C\\to D\\bigr)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\nd_0^D F_1=F_0d_0^C\\land d_1^D F_1=F_0d_1^C\\\\\n&\\land F_1e_C=e_DF_0\\\\\n&\\land(\\exists F_2\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(C_2,D_2))\\Bigl[\n\\pi_1^D F_2=F_1\\pi_1^C\\land\\pi_2^D F_2=F_1\\pi_2^C\\\\\n&\\hspace{38mm}\\land F_1m_C=m_DF_2\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"F_1\\pi_1^C,F_1\\pi_2^C","display":false},{"tex":"F_2","display":false},{"tex":"(g,f)","display":false}],"bytes":1627,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-267","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-functor|df-internal-functor]]"},{"id":"e030c919dd34652e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"内部范畴候选记录采用 [[16-df-internal-category]]，内部函子谓词采用 [[16-df-internal-functor]]。$F=(F_0,F_1):C\\to D$、$G=(G_0,G_1):D\\to E$ 表示满足该谓词的记录。"}],"outgoing":["75d304b3477bee01"]}